    "detailed_description": "Sylvantia is an indie creature collector. The whole forest gets controlled by an ancient god, which won\u00b4t let anybody escape it\u00b4s fangs. So the only viable solution is to defeat the ancient god and free the forest of the obscure curse.<br><br>Explore and hunt through the mysterious parts of the forest.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/05429c8c56817f96f74e488750ae3c89.poster.avif?t=1724810214\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/05429c8c56817f96f74e488750ae3c89.webm?t=1724810214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/05429c8c56817f96f74e488750ae3c89.mp4?t=1724810214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Collect many different Antia\u00b4s and use their powerful skills to your advantage.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/7041559bb3bdaea69ab7b6eada01feca.poster.avif?t=1724810214\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/7041559bb3bdaea69ab7b6eada01feca.webm?t=1724810214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/7041559bb3bdaea69ab7b6eada01feca.mp4?t=1724810214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Start fishing in the forest to get even more unique Antia\u00b4s and items.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/717c2598b3e77636d2245b6919db39af.poster.avif?t=1724810214\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/717c2598b3e77636d2245b6919db39af.webm?t=1724810214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/717c2598b3e77636d2245b6919db39af.mp4?t=1724810214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Maybe you will even encounter rare shiny Antia\u00b4s on your journey.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/5b0493029e57015372de4dcd42543dea.poster.avif?t=1724810214\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/5b0493029e57015372de4dcd42543dea.webm?t=1724810214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464510/extras/5b0493029e57015372de4dcd42543dea.mp4?t=1724810214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">The game features:<li>over 70 different Antia\u00b4s for you to collect<br></li><li>shiny variants for every Antia<br></li><li>boss fights against the ancient gods<br></li><li>crystal skills &amp; shards to create unique fight situations <br></li><li>collectibles for an extra challenge<br></li><li>evolutions for all Antia<br></li><li>an emerging story<br></li><li>many achievements for you to accomplish</li></ul><br>*All the content is still work in progress so things might change for the final release<br><br>Promotional artwork by Acalysth",
